---
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
---
<Page title="Customer updates | Relyxus" description="Status pages and client notices that go out only after a second person approves them, with a guard that blocks leaked internal details." path="/product/customer-updates" tone="light" current="/product">
  <section class="k-sec k-white cu-hero">
    <div class="wrap k-split"><div><span class="k-tag" style="color:#7FA0D6"><i class="d"></i>Customer updates</span><h1 class="k-h1" style="margin-top:16px">Tell customers first.</h1><p class="k-lede">Status page updates and client notices drafted from the live incident, approved by a second person, then sent to every subscriber.</p></div>
      <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true"><div class="scr"><div class="time">23:59</div><div class="n bank"><b>Harbour Bank</b><span>Card payments are slower than usual. We are fixing it now.</span></div><div class="n soc"><b>Social</b><span>Is anyone else's card not working?</span></div><div class="n soc"><b>Social</b><span>Harbour Bank down again?</span></div></div></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="k-sec k-mist cu-two"><div class="wrap k-split"><div class="pair" aria-hidden="true"><div class="upd k-card"><small>Draft update</small><p>Card payments are slower than usual. We are fixing it now and will update you by 00:30.</p><div class="who"><span class="a">EC</span><span class="a b">DH</span><em>Waiting for a second approver</em></div></div></div><div><h2 class="k-h2">No update leaves <span>without a second pair of eyes.</span></h2><p class="k-lede">The author cannot approve their own update. The second approver sees exactly what customers will see, on every channel.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="k-sec k-dark cu-guard"><div class="wrap k-split"><div><h2 class="k-h2">It refuses updates that leak <span>IP addresses or host names.</span></h2><p class="k-lede">The leak guard checks every word before it goes. Internal host names, IP addresses and email addresses are blocked, and the send button stays locked until they are gone.</p></div>
    <div class="ed k-card"><p>We restarted <mark>payments-api.prod.internal</mark> at <mark>10.42.7.18</mark>. Contact <mark>oncall@harbourbank.co.uk</mark> for details.</p><div class="bt"><span><i class="ti ti-shield-x"></i>3 internal details found</span><button disabled>Send update</button></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="k-sec k-white cu-cl"><div class="wrap"><h2 class="k-h2">Your biggest clients <span>hear from you by name.</span></h2><div class="k-g3" style="margin-top:40px">{["Northfield Bank", "Union Point Bank", "Kestrel Pay"].map((c, i) => <div class="k-card cc"><b>{c}</b><small>Contract: notify within 4 hours</small><span class="tick"><i class="ti ti-checks"></i>Delivered {["00:06", "00:07", "00:09"][i]}</span></div>)}</div><p class="k-note">Client names are examples.</p></div></section>
</Page>
<style is:global>
.cu-hero{padding:96px 0}.cu-hero .phone{width:300px;height:520px;justify-self:center;border-radius:46px;background:#0A0C10;padding:12px;box-shadow:0 40px 80px rgba(10,14,22,.3)}
.cu-hero .scr{height:100%;border-radius:36px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#1E2A44,#3A2A4E);padding:24px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.cu-hero .time{text-align:center;color:#fff;font-family:var(--display);font-size:56px;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:14px}
.cu-hero .n{background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border-radius:16px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13.5px;animation:py-in 6s ease infinite both}
.cu-hero .n b{display:block;font-size:13px}.cu-hero .n.bank{border:2px solid #3DAE80}.cu-hero .n.soc{opacity:.75}.cu-hero .soc:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.8s}.cu-hero .soc:nth-child(4){animation-delay:1.4s}
.cu-two .upd{padding:22px}.cu-two .upd small{color:var(--muted)}.cu-two .upd p{font-size:18px;margin:8px 0 16px}
.cu-two .who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.cu-two .a{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#0A0C10;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
.cu-two .a.b{background:#fff;color:#0A0C10;border:2px dashed #9AA6B8;animation:cu-join 4s ease infinite}
@keyframes cu-join{0%,40%{transform:translateX(30px);opacity:0}60%,100%{transform:none;opacity:1;border-style:solid;border-color:#3DAE80}}
.cu-two .who em{font-style:normal;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.cu-guard .ed{padding:24px}.cu-guard .ed p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;margin:0}
.cu-guard mark{background:transparent;color:#FF8A66;text-decoration:underline wavy #FF6B4A;text-underline-offset:5px;animation:cu-mask 5s ease infinite}
@keyframes cu-mask{0%,50%{background:transparent}70%,100%{background:#FF6B4A;color:#FF6B4A}}
.cu-guard .bt{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #232B3A}
.cu-guard .bt span{color:#FF8A66;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.cu-guard button{background:#2C3546;color:#E9EEF5;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-weight:600}
.cu-cl .cc{padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.cu-cl .cc b{font-size:19px}.cu-cl .cc small{color:var(--muted)}.cu-cl .tick{color:#17694A;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:10px}
</style>
